    "title": "Young child found dead inside Harrison Twp. home - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kdka Radio Staff ,\n7 hours ago\nAllegheny County Police say an investigation is underway into the death of a young child in Harrison Township.\nPolice said the child was pronounced dead inside a home on Pine Street in the Natrona Heights section of Harrison around noon Wednesday.\nOfficials did not provide any additional details but did confirm that they are now investigating.\n2",
